<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges up to 4.5625 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges up to 4.5625 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.5625 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.5635 on July 25.</p>
<p>				   July 28    July 25</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.5625     4.5635</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   450,000    250,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
